{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Castor walks in and sees the ceremony deciding not to interrupt and just stands in the corner and eyes this person","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:32:04.401000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737089890658811914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Please, enlighten me on this day you speak of.\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:32:46.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737090068837040189","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"The day of the black sun was a great battle against a scourge again the divine beings we worshipped. Some were corruptes by this battle and others had govem their lives to cast the scourge away and save the others.\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:34:02.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737090387696550071","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Florian goes on to explain the entire premise for you to hear","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:34:07.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737090408156233738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"The Knights du Roi Soleil represent everything Arcania fears, regardless of whether or not some of their fears are misguided. The will of the gods is vast and varied, but they existed to help and guide mortals through life. Giving them strength when they needed it, and hope when they were without it. Somewhere in the cycle of Croatoan years ago, the Day of the Black Sun commenced and all warmth that emanated from Machidiel's power was destroyed. One man's divine oath before all the living gods of good faith ignited a movement and passion inside the founding order: the Knights du Roi Soleil, the sun king.\nThe Eclipse Knight who began the order was lost, however his deeds were not forgotten, as the Knights spread their ideals through pure hearts and minds into the world. All those who gave their faith to any God of just nature could find sanctuary within their walls and a purpose within.","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:34:22.799000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737090471142359091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"The dark days did not cease however, as when tales of a monstrosity so evil had been delivered unto the highest heights of the Celestial mountain palaces of the gods, a great battle took place. The battle of epic proportions could not be contained to that single plane, as the great evil hunger called upon its creations and followers, dividing the gods forces and luring them to the material plane. Catastrophic damage would have been done to all mortals had the gods not brought it to the abyssal Atlantic Ocean. Many gods here suffered casualties of grand proportion. An outcome too costly to be called a victory, for they gave their lives to only delay the inevitable in an unearthly prison, to let its hunger swell to insatiable size.","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:34:30.099000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737090501760516157","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"This Pyrrhic success dubbed the Battle of the Atlantic Abyss led for many newer and younger gods to take up the mantle in attempts to guide others and answer upon divine call, however the last battle of the gods solidified the Knights du Roi Soleil's path. It is their belief and practice that through the combined conviction of man and the lost relics of the gods, they can face this ancient evil being and untwist the corrupted souls that follow it.","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:34:36.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737090526955962408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
